bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Welcome to the Adventurer's Guild Management Game!

You are the guildmaster of a humble tavern where adventurers gather.
Each day, you must manage your resources wisely:
- Recruit adventurers.
- Assign them to missions based on their class.

- Restock beer to attract guests and earn gold.

- Try not to run out of money, beer, or adventurers.

- Tax day comes every 30 days! Be ready, it's 1000 gold coins ! Gold and beer are your lifelines. When you're out of both  or it’s over.

Good luck, Guildmaster!"
scroll_following = true
tab_size = 10

